-names>Y</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>EEG and topography during Chinese &#x02018;Qigong&#x02019; training</article-title><source>Neurosiences</source><year>1990</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>503</fpage><lpage>8</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B37"><label>37</label><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Shinagawa</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name></person-group><year>1990</year><publisher-loc>Tokyo</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Kobunsha</publisher-name><comment><italic>The Science of Qigong</italic> (in Japanese)</comment></citation></ref><ref id="B38"><label>38</label><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Machi</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name></person-group><year>1993</year><publisher-loc>Tokyo</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Tokyo Denki University Press</publisher-name><comment><italic>The Science of Ki</italic> (in Japanese)</comment></citation></ref><ref id="B39"><label>39</label><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yuasa</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-group-type="translator"><name><surname>Nagatomo</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Kasulis</surname><given-names>TP</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Kasulis</surname><given-names>TP</given-names></name></person-group><year>1987</year><publisher-loc>Albany, New York</publisher-loc><publisher-name>State University of New York</publisher-name><comment><italic>The Body: Toward an Eastern Mind-Body Theory</italic></comment></citation></ref><ref id="B40"><label>40</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Shannon</surname><given-names>CE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A mathematical theory of communication</article-title><source>B